  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mini Northern Plains is colder, and toward the extreme north there is nothing. After Fang Yuan annexes Han Dong’s blessed land, a spirit snake resource point managed by the pink spirit snake land spirit sits there, along with the bone burial field of bone immortal materials. To the south he works to create a blood red grassland on blood sickle grass and red axe flowers for pink flower rabbits, wolves, and foxes.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_han_dong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The snowman tribe lives in Mini Northern Plains and encounters trouble of its own while inkman allies in Mini Western Desert face spreading vegetation.",
      "chapters": [
        2127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "snowman-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Triple Sacred Mountain is the center of Mini Northern Plains, the gathering area of snowmen, and the most developed area there. Xue Er looks after it. Sacred Eagle City also stands in Mini Northern Plains, inhabited mostly by humans from Beast Calamity grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "plains-governance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_triple_sacred_mountain",
        "char_xue_er",
        "loc_sacred_eagle_city",
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A mission board entry reports dog shit falling from the sky in Mini Northern Plains, piling into mountains and polluting the frost dragon’s lake, and asks for the cause to be found and cleared away.",
      "chapters": [
        2242
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
